AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::setReferral
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when referral address is not whitelisted and not zero address
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when referred user equals referral address (self-referral)
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when parameters are valid
        ├── when referral address is whitelisted
        │   ├── it should set referral mapping
        │   └── it should emit ReferralSet event
        ├── when referral address is zero address (reset)
        │   ├── it should set referral mapping to zero
        │   └── it should emit ReferralSet event
        ├── when updating existing referral
        │   ├── it should update referral mapping
        │   └── it should emit ReferralSet event
        └── when setting referral for multiple users
            ├── it should set referral mapping for each user
            └── it should emit ReferralSet event for each user
